# Requests for trying the API. Filled in task by task; complete list in T12.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5152

### OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### --- Auth (T5) ---

### Register (always a Customer; a "role" in the body is ignored)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "phone": "08012345678"
}

### Login: copy data.token into @token below
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### Who am I
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update my profile (name and phone only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ada King",
  "phone": "08087654321"
}

### No token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### Malformed JSON -> 400 INVALID_JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ada@example.com",

### --- Catalogue (T6, public) ---

### Categories (cached 30 min)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### Products: first page, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Products: search, filter and sort
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?search=shirt&minPrice=1000&maxPrice=50000&sortBy=price_asc&page=1&pageSize=5

### Products in one category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?categoryId=1

### One product (cached 10 min)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### Unknown product -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/99999

### pageSize over 50 / unknown sortBy -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?pageSize=100&sortBy=cheapest

### minPrice > maxPrice -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?minPrice=500&maxPrice=100

### --- Cart (T7, Customer only; log in above first) ---

### My cart: current prices, subtotals, total, and isAvailable per line
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a product (adding it again increases the quantity)
# @name addItem
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

###
@itemId = {{addItem.response.body.$.data.items[0].id}}

### More than the stock -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1000
}

### Unknown product -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 99999,
  "quantity": 1
}

### Set a line's quantity (0 removes it)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### Item not in my cart -> 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1
}

### Remove one line -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Empty the cart -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Orders (T8, Customer only) ---

### Put something in the cart first
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1
}

### Checkout -> 201. Empty cart -> 400; not enough stock -> 409 naming the product
# @name placeOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingFullName": "Ada King",
  "shippingPhone": "08087654321",
  "street": "12 Marina Road",
  "city": "Lagos",
  "state": "Lagos"
}

###
@orderId = {{placeOrder.response.body.$.data.id}}

### My orders, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One order with its lines (snapshot name and price)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Someone else's or unknown order -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel (Pending only) -> 200, stock returned. Cancelling again -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
